WEBVTT

00:03:30.316 --> 00:03:32.836
BCG recently worked
with a wealth management firm

00:03:32.876 --> 00:03:36.996
to figure out what predicts success
for incoming financial advisers.

00:03:37.316 --> 00:03:39.716
And the results were kind of interesting.

00:03:40.476 --> 00:03:42.076
High GPA?

00:03:42.116 --> 00:03:43.236
Important.

00:03:43.596 --> 00:03:45.076
Top school?

00:03:45.076 --> 00:03:46.236
Not important.

00:03:46.916 --> 00:03:49.116
Past client and sales experience?

00:03:49.156 --> 00:03:50.316
Not important.

00:03:50.836 --> 00:03:52.796
Past call center experience?

00:03:52.836 --> 00:03:53.996
Not important.

00:03:54.396 --> 00:03:58.716
Past experience working
on a team of any kind?

00:03:58.756 --> 00:03:59.916
Important.

00:03:59.956 --> 00:04:01.516
So of course we have to remember